https://docs.aws.amazon.com/prescriptive-guidance/latest/oca-framework-mobilize-team/team-structure.html

To create the project team structure, complete the following:

# Review the OCA program charter.
# Review the scope and cloud readiness assessment outputs.
# Review the change impact assessment outputs.
# Review the high-level change Impacts (if available).
# Review the discovery materials (as needed).
# Engage cloud project leadership, internal change team (if available), HR business partner, and internal communications or training leaders for input on team structure.
# Interview IT functional leaders to validate gaps, organizational changes, and impacts to roles.
# Confirm and validate the work effort required for each role:
#* OCA lead
#* Communications lead
#* Training lead
#* Other roles as necessary
# Present the team structure to cloud leadership for approval.
# Identify internal resources or retain staffing externally.
# Onboard the OCA team.
# Introduce, onboard, and engage the OCA  team.